# Data Layer (DevSpeak)

CRUD and Auth go through **supabase-kt** in `data/`. Domain sees only repository interfaces.

Do **not** create Retrofit `*Service` or Moshi DTOs. Preferences go through DataStore (`healthtrack_prefs`). Local tables use Room entities and DAOs.

## Repository Interface (domain)

```kotlin
interface ProfileRepository {
    fun observeProfile(): Flow<Profile?>
    suspend fun getProfile(): Result<Profile>
}
```

No Android, Supabase, or HTTP types on this interface.

## Remote DataSource (data)

Wrap supabase-kt here. Inject `Auth` / `SupabaseClient` into data sources, never ViewModels.
Always `filter { eq("user_id", userId) }`. After `update`, call `select()` to decode the row.

```kotlin
@Singleton
class ProfileRemoteDataSource @Inject constructor(
    private val client: SupabaseClient,
) {
    suspend fun fetchProfile(userId: String): ProfileResponse =
        client.from(Constants.Tables.PROFILES)
            .select {
                filter { eq("user_id", userId) }
            }
            .decodeSingle()

    suspend fun updateOnboarding(
        userId: String,
        request: ProfileOnboardingRequest,
    ): ProfileResponse =
        client.from(Constants.Tables.PROFILES)
            .update(request) {
                filter { eq("user_id", userId) }
                select()
            }
            .decodeSingle()
}
```

Chat streaming (Phase 2): OkHttp SSE in a remote data source, still behind `ChatRepository`.

## DTO

`kotlinx.serialization`. Column names = Postgres snake_case.

```kotlin
@Serializable
data class ProfileResponse(
    val id: String,
    @SerialName("user_id") val userId: String,
    @SerialName("english_level") val englishLevel: String? = null,
    @SerialName("learning_goals") val learningGoals: List<String> = emptyList(),
)
```

## Mapper

Enum **name** = stored text. Unknown strings → `null` / drop (do not crash).

```kotlin
fun ProfileResponse.toProfile(): Profile = Profile(
    id = id,
    userId = userId,
    englishLevel = englishLevel.toEnumOrNull<EnglishLevel>(),
    developerRole = developerRole.toEnumOrNull<DeveloperRole>(),
    dailyGoalMinutes = DailyGoalMinutes.fromMinutes(dailyGoalMinutes),
    learningGoals = learningGoals.mapNotNull { it.toEnumOrNull<LearningGoal>() },
    explanationLanguage = explanationLanguage,
    preferredDifficulty = preferredDifficulty,
)

internal inline fun <reified T : Enum<T>> String?.toEnumOrNull(): T? {
    if (this.isNullOrBlank()) return null
    return enumValues<T>().find { it.name == this }
}
```

Full templates (request body, observe+refresh, mapper/UseCase tests): skill `single-module-create-repository`.

## Repository Implementation

```kotlin
class ProfileRepositoryImpl @Inject constructor(
    private val remote: ProfileRemoteDataSource,
    private val dispatcher: AppDispatcher,
) : ProfileRepository {

    override suspend fun getProfile(): Result<Profile> =
        withContext(dispatcher.io) {
            try {
                Result.success(remote.fetchProfile(userId).toProfile())
            } catch (e: CancellationException) {
                throw e
            } catch (e: Exception) {
                Result.failure(e)
            }
        }
}
```

Rethrow `CancellationException`. Map SDK errors to `AppError` in **presentation** (or a data mapper used only from impl), not in UseCases.

## UseCase

```kotlin
class ObserveProfileUseCase @Inject constructor(
    private val repository: ProfileRepository,
) {
    operator fun invoke(): Flow<Profile?> = repository.observeProfile()
}
```

UseCases must not import `io.github.jan.supabase`.

## Local: DataStore and Room

Both are used.

- **DataStore** (`healthtrack_prefs`, `data/datasource/local/`): theme and other preferences. Auth session storage is handled by supabase-kt Auth — do not duplicate tokens in DataStore. Do not put measurement rows in prefs.
- **Room** (entity, DAO, `DatabaseModule`): local tables. For HealthTrack that is `tubuh` and `ukur`, as in `docs/rencana-aplikasi-android.md`.

## Not default (do not scaffold)

| Avoid | Unless |
|---|---|
| Retrofit `data/service/` + Moshi | User asks to talk to a non-Supabase REST API |
| `compose-auth` in `presentation/` | Never — Credential Manager + UseCase instead |
